<title>HONG KONG: China Everbright appoints chairman.</title>
<headline>China Everbright appoints chairman.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Property and securities trading concern China Everbright International Ltd said on Friday it had appointed Zhu Xiaohua as a director and chairman with effect from December 12.</p>
<p>Zhu is chairman of the company's controlling shareholder China Everbright Holdings Co Ltd.</p>
<p>The company said Zhu was a deputy governor of the People's Bank of China and the deputy director of the economics department at the Hong Kong branch of Xinhua news agency prior to joining the China Everbright group in July.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
